# Derived KG/corpus artifacts that NOTHING in the tree reads. `run_eval_final.py` opens exactly
# two files from export/ — corpus.jsonl and graph-hyperedges.kv — and those two stay tracked so
# the harness runs from a clean clone. The six below were 110 MB of pipeline output with no
# reader anywhere in the repository, and no in-tree config regenerates them; they are a snapshot
# of one run, not a fixture. Same posture as benchmark/enterprise-gold/.gitignore, which ships
# corpus/ + run_pipeline.py and keeps its derived store/ local.
export/corpus.parquet
export/graph-nodes.parquet
export/graph-edges.parquet
export/graph-hyperedges.parquet
export/graph.ttl
export/graph.graphml
__pycache__/
